\newlabel{fig:densityscaling}{{5}{9}{Packing efficiency $\eta $ versus $N$ (left) and versus $1/\!\sqrt {N}$ (right). The approximately linear relationship with $1/\!\sqrt {N}$ suggests $\eta (N) \approx \eta _\infty + c/\!\sqrt {N}$ with a limiting density $\eta _\infty $ as $N \to \infty $}{figure.caption.26}{}}
